{"title": "High Heralds", "pageid": 15994, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/High_Heralds", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>High Heralds</b> were a respected council of intellectuals. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>They served as leading authorities on heraldry, history, genealogy, and diplomacy. The <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> used to be their fortress.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Literature\">Related Literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necromantic_Codexes,_Their_Enigmas\" title=\"Necromantic Codexes, Their Enigmas\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Book_Tome_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Necromantic_Codexes,_Their_Enigmas\" title=\"Necromantic Codexes, Their Enigmas\">Necromantic Codexes, Their Enigmas</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Astral_Prism_Heist\" titl